Rule 7 (x and y are broadcast-compatible, aligning from trailing dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (∀k ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - k) = (if k < ndim(v_2) then shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - k) else 1) ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - k) = 1 ∨ (if k < ndim(v_2) then shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - k) else 1) = 1)) ∧ (∀k ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : ((if k < ndim(v_1) then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - k) else 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - k) ∨ (if k < ndim(v_1) then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - k) else 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - k) = 1))
