Rule 9 (if ranks are equal, per-axis sizes either match or are 1)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1)
>>
Rule 12 (when ranks differ, the extra leading dimensions must be 1 for broadcasting)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 1 else if ndim(v_2) > ndim(v_1) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) = 1
>>
Rule 14 (trailing-dimension broadcasting compatibility between x and y)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : if i + ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 then (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i + ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1)) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i + ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1)) = 1) else shape(v_1, i) = 1) ∧ (∀j ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : if j + ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) ≥ 0 then (shape(v_2, j) = shape(v_1, j + ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2)) ∨ shape(v_2, j) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, j + ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2)) = 1) else shape(v_2, j) = 1)
>>
Rule 15 (same-rank case: per-dimension equality or broadcasting by 1)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)) ∨ (shape(v_1, i) = 1) ∨ (shape(v_2, i) = 1)
>>
Rule 16 (all dimension sizes are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0) ∧ (∀j ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, j) ≥ 0)
